{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:df0a16e699f663a50f4d5e6e6c713d6911bfea4a70e5711b2f9bd0d76c314920",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1d861718ccd1388bb729da0ac6814be34a8b76b80ee2ca51a090a9c214da418",
      "text": "喂喂，是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n昨天上线的那一集，我刚才也看了哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c17d80d13889db3916f7b337857f97b0213e67874a52c6c0cb80f85ac4186592",
      "text": "犯人的真面目终于揭晓了呢～。\n就算明明知道剧情，心里还是怦怦直跳呀～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b960c2dbee20df27b122b1233808c15797e28903511ccd43c58f1b20646a14ba",
      "text": "事务所的大家也都很期待那一集的播出呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df34466e6aba0cecf0807429af1aa73e26db3f0bb0f397a189a1d6663051cf9",
      "text": "因为他们叮嘱我不要剧透，所以我一直\n都没能坦白自己就是犯人呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:110788cf16e58fe565d6f13838bafa2f6287229cea6127abd348a7be3cef0cc3",
      "text": "这样一来，从今天起就能堂堂正正地去听大家的感想了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb9eb122a86533a08b26be30ac3a47784c5fe26bada835202a38ba8da9a622ca",
      "text": "因为是个难度很高的角色，拍摄期间我也找了很多人商量……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a74e90c43543874673c95f9664340ebd84f83ab75885adadd9bec45e8d2878d1",
      "text": "不过制作人听我倾诉得最多，\n我真的很感激你呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a35004bbe1a83e65c5da987fc181e592ad75021af437b5f27c1c3188358249e",
      "text": "最终呈现了一部\n很棒的作品呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2384efe4302d149c5be7bc4c0876c12be762a84cb78ec4867792e7a2e3777c82",
      "text": "结束拍摄后\n有什么感想吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86ba5906a2a25a2f53c88187a98f70c0e533612be1a1c1d80a22c26940199307",
      "text": "是呀～。正因为剧本很有趣，\n我才更觉得必须拼尽全力不可呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99f54e4affe5991f4348e32b9004b45d5dde26a8bb2b2ae37e54536952f41d0a",
      "text": "因为是个具有两面性的角色，\n难点也有很多呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f9caf30d0c24ad9897762d40167a67d658da6d2b85a740609d48cde9b5c4458",
      "text": "从围读剧本到实际拍摄，一直都有你从旁守护，\n真的帮了我大忙呀～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf10baa8825dcc10b547b66024b37648b677e727c2ed91716b2d8751e9973ff8",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n一直以来都愿意倾听我说话，谢谢你～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:045sor_402_2_4_045_02_09_a:2_4_045_02_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3b00136dc870c2cfec39a1551b5125bc22313939afcc0820c9e186eb41feae9",
      "text": "有所得悟，踏上新征途。为了能遇见崭新的自己，今后我也会继续加油的～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
